  "description": "Revenge and love of the last remaining werewolves!\n\nLuna, the youngest prince of the Airoon Kingdom, is kidnapped by mysterious gangsters while on his way to an allied Qatar country against a strategic marriage. Luna, dragged by the kidnappers' chief, promises to do whatever it takes to save the life of the injured maid on his behalf, begging the boss for her life...\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
